{
  "tema": 7481,
  "slug": "toca",
  "titulo": "Tocar + infinitive = it's someone's turn / time to do something",
  "subtitulo": "Te toca lavar los trastes. Toca ahorrar.",
  "foto": "t10.jpg",
  "regla": "(Me / te / le...) toca + infinitive = it's (my / your...) turn to, or something has to be done: Te toca tirar el dado. Nos toca ahorrar. Toca is always singular. ¿A quién le toca? = Whose turn is it?",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "(me / te / le / nos / les) + toca",
            "+",
            "infinitive"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "usos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "forma": "someone's turn",
              "texto": "**Sara, te toca tirar.** **¿A quién le toca sacar la basura?**"
            },
            {
              "forma": "it has to be done",
              "texto": "**Toca ahorrar.** **Nos toca madrugar.**"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Works like **gustar**, but **tocar** is **always singular** here, in any tense: **les tocó recoger todo**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **te toca** = the ball's in your court."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Los niños necesitan zapatos nuevos, así que ==toca ahorrar==.",
              "en": "The kids need new shoes, so we have to save."
            },
            {
              "es": "Así que ==nos toca ahorrar==.",
              "en": "So we have to save."
            },
            {
              "es": "Sara, ==te toca tirar== el dado.",
              "en": "Sara, it's your turn to roll the die."
            },
            {
              "es": "—¿A quién ==le toca sacar== la basura hoy? —A Javier.",
              "en": "—Whose turn is it to take out the trash today? —Javier's."
            },
            {
              "es": "Cuando yo sea vieja, ==te va a tocar aguantar== mis mañas.",
              "en": "When I'm old, you'll have to put up with my quirks."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Les tocó recoger== todo y trapear el piso.",
              "en": "They had to clean everything up and mop the floor."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
